{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfMVWsA1rkZoHuGRUBWMs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YaFY4jH9DcGqrMC5aUKJrh","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/01-theme-end-to-end-system-mode.md","content":"# 01: Theme end-to-end: System mode with profile field\n\n**Blocked by:** None\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd a `themePreference` profile field (default \"system\"), a theme control on the Settings page, and live OS tracking applied before first paint.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A user with no saved preference sees the theme that matches their OS, with no flash on load, and it updates live when the OS setting changes.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":18750,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"b9cb5177-10af-4b51-9941-53462ddab0e4","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:18.398Z","request_id":"req_011CfMVWrjiU4LS9qfu4cDea","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01YaFY4jH9DcGqrMC5aUKJrh":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/01-theme-end-to-end-system-mode.md","content":"# 01: Theme end-to-end: System mode with profile field\n\n**Blocked by:** None\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd a `themePreference` profile field (default \"system\"), a theme control on the Settings page, and live OS tracking applied before first paint.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A user with no saved preference sees the theme that matches their OS, with no flash on load, and it updates live when the OS setting changes.\n"}}}
